{"suttaId":"tha-ap308","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[9130,9154],"vripara":"24"},"segments":{"tha-ap308:0.3":"Sampasādakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap308:1.1":"“‘Namo te buddha vīratthu, vippamuttosi sabbadhi;","tha-ap308:1.3":"Byasanamhi [byasanaṃ hi (sī.)] anuppatto, tassa me saraṇaṃ bhava’.","tha-ap308:2.1":"“Siddhattho tassa byākāsi, loke appaṭipuggalo;","tha-ap308:2.3":"‘Mahodadhisamo saṅgho, appameyyo anuttaro.","tha-ap308:3.1":"“‘Tattha tvaṃ viraje khette, anantaphaladāyake;","tha-ap308:3.3":"Saṅghe cittaṃ pasādetvā, subījaṃ vāpa [cāpi (sī.), vāpi (syā.)] ropaya.","tha-ap308:4.1":"“Idaṃ vatvāna sabbaññū, lokajeṭṭho narāsabho;","tha-ap308:4.3":"Mameva anusāsitvā, vehāsaṃ nabhamuggami.","tha-ap308:5.1":"“Aciraṃ gatamattamhi, sabbaññumhi narāsabhe;","tha-ap308:5.3":"Maraṇaṃ samanuppatto, tusitaṃ upapajjahaṃ.","tha-ap308:6.1":"“Tadāhaṃ viraje khette, anantaphaladāyake;","tha-ap308:6.3":"Saṅghe cittaṃ pasādetvā, kappaṃ saggamhi modahaṃ.","tha-ap308:7.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, pasādamalabhiṃ tadā;","tha-ap308:7.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, pasādassa idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap308:8.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap308:9.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sampasādako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap308:10.1":"Sampasādakattherassāpadānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
